  "title": "广告巨头Adform脚本遭供应链劫持：深度解析恶意JS如何精准篡改加密货币钱包地址",
  "covers": [
    "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-safe-hub/main/assets/today/cover_01.jpg",
    "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-safe-hub/main/assets/today/cover_02.jpg"
